### 1. Dashboard - current year by default
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/dashboard/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Dashboard - selected date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/dashboard/?date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-16
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Complete trial balance list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Search accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/?search=cash
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Filter assets only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/?type=asset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Filter liabilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/?type=liability
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Search and filter by date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/?search=bank&type=asset&date_from=2026-01-01&date_to=2026-10-16
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Invalid date test
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/trial-balance/dashboard/?date_from=invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
